  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "C38DF125E6D2FF90",
      "text": "¡Aaaah! ¡Se me ha hecho tardísimo![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "7C6C59D62A6DB258",
      "text": "¡Don Fuco! ¡Espereee!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "7C6C5CD62A6DB771",
      "text": "Se ha ido... Y encima ha olvidado esto...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "7C6C5BD62A6DB5BE",
      "text": "Oye, tú no habrás venido a presentarte al\\nexamen de gimnasio, ¿verdad?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "D3677BC9BEA50865",
      "text": "¡Sí!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "D36778C9BEA5034C",
      "text": "Pues...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_04a",
      "hash64": "D9DFDBEA18744342",
      "text": "¡Lo sabía! Se te ve en la cara.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_04b",
      "hash64": "D9DFDAEA1874418F",
      "text": "La emoción te ha dejado sin palabras, pero está\\nclaro que has venido a eso. ¿A qué si no?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "7C6C5DD62A6DB924",
      "text": "Ese tipo tan fortachón que acaba de salir pitando\\nes nada menos que Fuco, el Líder de Gimnasio\\r\\nde Ciudad Cántara.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "7C6C60D62A6DBE3D",
      "text": "Es tan impulsivo que a veces se le va la cabeza.\\c\\nFíjate que ha salido al mercado a comprar y se\\nha dejado aquí la cartera.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "7C6C5FD62A6DBC8A",
      "text": "Verás tú el bochorno cuando vaya a pagar...\\c\\nA no ser que tú, simpátic[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa y pizpiret[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa aspirante,\\nte ofrezcas generosamente a ir a entregársela.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_08a",
      "hash64": "D9B6D3EA18513096",
      "text": "¡Qué derroche de bondad y amor al prójimo!\\c\\n¡Casi dan ganas de otorgarte una medalla solo\\npor eso!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_08b",
      "hash64": "D9B6D2EA18512EE3",
      "text": "Pues lo siento, pero sin Fuco no podrás afrontar\\nel gimnasio como es debido. Y yo no puedo\\r\\nabandonar mi puesto de recepcionista...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "7C6C51D62A6DA4C0",
      "text": "¡Cuento contigo, joven!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "7C6954D62A6B7402",
      "text": "Si le entregas la cartera, haré una excepción y\\ndaré por aprobado tu examen de gimnasio.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_11",
      "hash64": "7C6955D62A6B75B5",
      "text": "Fuco ha ido a [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Pueblo Marinada[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], que está pasado\\nel desierto del oeste.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_12",
      "hash64": "7C6952D62A6B709C",
      "text": "Por cierto, el desierto está plagado de Pokémon\\npeligrosos, así que ándate con mucho ojo.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
